{
  "id": 8867217965255,
  "title": "Teal Yellow Softball Bedding Set – Stylish Sports Bedroom Decor",
  "handle": "teal-yellow-softball-bedding-set-stylish-sports-bedroom-decor",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a vibrant haven with this stylish Softball Comforter Set from Jeminise. Designed for softball players and fans alike, this bedding set offers a soft and smooth feel, making it a perfect addition for a cozy and spirited sleep space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Celebrate your passion for softball or surprise a loved one with this thoughtful sports-themed bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ultra-soft Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for exceptional softness, smoothness, and durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fade-Resistant:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process that helps the fabric retain its dye and prevents fading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes a comfortable comforter, perfect for creating a complete look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this comforter is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low for best results.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
